              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "CDIAL has no entry for कदी (kadī), so its history is not settled. Its k- is the old question stem: CDIAL lists Hindi kabhī, \"ever\", under Sanskrit evam eva, \"exactly so\", crossed with the stem ka- (CDIAL 2528), but nothing with the shape of कदी (kadī)."
